{{/*
    anon_consts.tmpl — untyped const block for anonymous (tag-less) C enums.

    These constants have no enclosing type, so they are emitted as bare untyped
    package-level constants, exactly as the raw layer does. Names and values are
    resolved in the gather phase; the template is pure structural shape.
*/}}
{{define "anon_consts" -}}
const (
{{range .}}{{.CommentBlock}}	{{.ConstName}} = {{.Value}}
{{end}})

{{end}}
